{"id": "EUVD-2026-38698", "enisaUuid": "e033c143-1421-3091-a114-ce73a5ab3e90", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\naf_unix: Reject SIOCATMARK on non-stream sockets\n\nSIOCATMARK reports whether the receive queue is at the urgent mark for\nMSG_OOB.\n\nIn AF_UNIX, MSG_OOB is supported only for SOCK_STREAM sockets.\nSOCK_DGRAM and SOCK_SEQPACKET reject MSG_OOB in sendmsg() and recvmsg(),\nso they should not support SIOCATMARK either.\n\nReturn -EOPNOTSUPP for non-stream sockets before checking the receive\nqueue.", "datePublished": "2026-06-24T07:14:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T01:21:51", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ec123873fdc83e7244c8ed6d17b8f8ea6c416a67", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f085971de6d6b8ef946a5e0bcd73ff24509a0f85", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b741c9c6ef59f17c1f104ddf1217ef77f79ed29b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/645b1ed3259af38b7814242a420bc2081bdd1eb6", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c34c41446acf6c0d13b5b06c809be11e0f7f2729", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3147ddf5a41c20c45c2eb69e00b62f10f822056a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d119775f2bad827edc28071c061fdd4a91f889a5"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-52928", "GHSA-3jxv-h97q-rq3x"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.11, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "117ff117-f393-369c-bae3-b3ec39a3bc7d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "314001f0bf927015e459c9d387d62a231fe93af3 <c34c41446acf6c0d13b5b06c809be11e0f7f2729"}, {"id": "11c35e44-997c-3012-ad9c-0cb0a1a6a2bc", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "291c7912-0bf5-3e26-bae9-eadfe66f2b2b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "314001f0bf927015e459c9d387d62a231fe93af3 <ec123873fdc83e7244c8ed6d17b8f8ea6c416a67"}, {"id": "2c5658cf-c091-3b91-ab1c-8e5fd8cb2002", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_ve